      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "〇〇くん｜♯シロクマ文芸部「20字小説」",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:11+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/tubaki2022/n/ncc3a491e88aa"
    },
    {
      "key": "nda59773031b7",
      "text": "撮ろうとしたら、雲一つない。眩しすぎだ。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "虹風　想蒔",
      "handle": "i_nw_ao_rbdmges",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "私も見上げてみたけれど　#20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:11+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/i_nw_ao_rbdmges/n/nda59773031b7"
    },
    {
      "key": "nc4902b76f8ad",
      "text": "金髪にピアスの彼、達筆で好感度７割増し。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "秋音（アキネ）",
      "handle": "shiny_squid3060",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "達筆",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:12+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/shiny_squid3060/n/nc4902b76f8ad"
    },
    {
      "key": "nb0b97f8620f1",
      "text": "ベッド上にカメムシ現る。同衾は御免蒙る。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "もりおん",
      "handle": "morion_202609",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20字小説/昨日の実話",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:15+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/morion_202609/n/nb0b97f8620f1"
    },
    {
      "key": "n7e3593ce3b0f",
      "text": "激しく転倒。ゴールしたのは、カツラだけ。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "おかゆの味",
      "handle": "gifted_macaw7043",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "【20字小説】父兄リレーで張り切りすぎた男【シロクマ文芸部】",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:16+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/gifted_macaw7043/n/n7e3593ce3b0f"
    },
    {
      "key": "n9e4706e5447b",
      "text": "サヨナラは、赤いクレヨンで書かれていた。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "あくがれ（在処離れ）",
      "handle": "sikiri_17",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:16+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/sikiri_17/n/n9e4706e5447b"
    },
    {
      "key": "n268e90ce451b",
      "text": "君が笑うたび、言えない言葉が増えていく。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "アラ還FP",
      "handle": "bunbunsixs43",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20字小説｜まだ言えない【シロクマ文芸部】",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:18+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/bunbunsixs43/n/n268e90ce451b"
    },
    {
      "key": "ncd0a001ad36a",
      "text": "無口な硬貨が五枚、牛乳で正座させられた。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "ムフフ",
      "handle": "ample_willet9504",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "『労働者』#20字小説#シロクマ文芸部",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:18+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/ample_willet9504/n/ncd0a001ad36a"
    },
    {
      "key": "n9be1fc55c47d",
      "text": "帰っておいで。顔を見せて。待ってるから。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "青豆ノノ",
      "handle": "aomame_nono",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20字小説 『プロパガンダ』",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:22+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/aomame_nono/n/n9be1fc55c47d"
    },
    {
      "key": "n766e1311ceff",
      "text": "「呑気なものだ。」グラスの中の男が呟く。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "gokkun",
      "handle": "brainy_pika1474",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "【20字小説】11月11日午前11時",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:24+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/brainy_pika1474/n/n766e1311ceff"
    },
    {
      "key": "nb41b3cab7102",
      "text": "あなたの好きと私の好きは、違う色だった。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "藤澤ころも｜ことば",
      "handle": "wisteria_coromo",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "【20字小説】好きにはグラデーションがあって｜シロクマ文芸部",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:27+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/wisteria_coromo/n/nb41b3cab7102"
    },
    {
      "key": "n669de60a493b",
      "text": "流れる文字と流れる音楽、頭に浮かぶ情景。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "❁ Ordeal ❁",
      "handle": "brainy_elk1055",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "エンドロール【シロクマ文芸部｜20字小説】",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:28+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/brainy_elk1055/n/n669de60a493b"
    },
    {
      "key": "n99c6c487fe74",
      "text": "君の言葉　とても美しいけど　味がしないね",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "渡鳥",
      "handle": "joyous_panda989",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "シロクマ文芸部/20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:29+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/joyous_panda989/n/n99c6c487fe74"
    },
    {
      "key": "nb0b0e3a4fcb3",
      "text": "クレーンゲームの景品が土地の権利書だと？",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "カイロウドウケツ",
      "handle": "keen_nerine6750",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "【20字小説】　やってみようかな",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:29+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/keen_nerine6750/n/nb0b0e3a4fcb3"
    },
    {
      "key": "n156ae8175ab0",
      "text": "石器、青銅器、鉄器、電器。…次はお前だ。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "増長　晃　📚🍃＠現代ファンタジー",
      "handle": "akira_masunaga",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "【シロクマ・20字小説】人の器のはなし",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:30+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/akira_masunaga/n/n156ae8175ab0"
    },
    {
      "key": "nbd305b766db0",
      "text": "足跡を辿る。生臭い…、近い「ドラ猫ぉ！」",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "中之人成",
      "handle": "akashiba555",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20字小説　「執念」　#シロクマ文芸部",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:30+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/akashiba555/n/nbd305b766db0"
    },
    {
      "key": "n7b05da6095c3",
      "text": "冬の空気は好きだ。冷たさが、紛れるから。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "深鏡 緋尚",
      "handle": "hinao_mikagami",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "《20字小説》同じ温度 ― 冬",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:34+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/hinao_mikagami/n/n7b05da6095c3"
    },
    {
      "key": "n10e7a435bad3",
      "text": "名前をつけることで新しい世界が生まれる。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "ひろいてん",
      "handle": "kind_gerbil810",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "そのネーミングの才能たるや【20字小説】【シロクマ文芸部】",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:36+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/kind_gerbil810/n/n10e7a435bad3"
    },
    {
      "key": "n6172f482f2a8",
      "text": "集め使わずは罪な気がした、アラ50の朝。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "72",
      "handle": "mute_bison1068",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20字小説　「切に思ふ」",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:36+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/mute_bison1068/n/n6172f482f2a8"
    },
    {
      "key": "n688783e5aa94",
      "text": "静寂の夜。探偵は恋人の浮気を悟り狼狽す。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "猫ノ宮おしゃけ",
      "handle": "fond_bee4215",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20文字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:37+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/fond_bee4215/n/n688783e5aa94"
    },
    {
      "key": "n4d1cc20575de",
      "text": "リップ変えた？オレでなきゃ見逃しちゃうね",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "月白のえ",
      "handle": "lucky_murre513",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "オレでなきゃ【20字小説】",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:39+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/lucky_murre513/n/n4d1cc20575de"
    },
    {
      "key": "na21c240a9531",
      "text": "目に焼き付けとく。いつか忘れちゃうけど。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "アージ | arji",
      "handle": "sun_pulan",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20字小説 | 2026.11.24",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:39+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/sun_pulan/n/na21c240a9531"
    },
    {
      "key": "n259cb9128dde",
      "text": "「月が綺麗」と呟くあの日の君に会いたい。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "kisaragi",
      "handle": "good_lily2699",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "今は今で（20字小説）#シロクマ文芸部",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:40+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/good_lily2699/n/n259cb9128dde"
    },
    {
      "key": "n59cc68cd070c",
      "text": "春の空気は嫌いだ。冷たさが、際立つから。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "深鏡 緋尚",
      "handle": "hinao_mikagami",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "《20字小説》同じ温度 ― 春",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:40+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/hinao_mikagami/n/n59cc68cd070c"
    },
    {
      "key": "n5cc1775efee9",
      "text": "愛を知り、体験するために生まれてきたの。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "ちかれいん",
      "handle": "rrrainn",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "私の使命✨",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:40+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/rrrainn/n/n5cc1775efee9"
    },
    {
      "key": "nf5169284e1ce",
      "text": "もう20時だなんて今更後悔しても遅いよ。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "蒔倉 みのむし",
      "handle": "3no64",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20時。【20字小説】",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:46+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/3no64/n/nf5169284e1ce"
    },
    {
      "key": "n5a77d13e2a23",
      "text": "カ〜ッとなり、赤く染まる床、人間だもの。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "中之人成",
      "handle": "akashiba555",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20字小説　「開き直り」　#シロクマ文芸部",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:49+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/akashiba555/n/n5a77d13e2a23"
    },
    {
      "key": "n6a4638d4bf41",
      "text": "エンドロールのその後に、君は何を思うか。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "❁ Ordeal ❁",
      "handle": "brainy_elk1055",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "Cパート【シロクマ文芸部｜20字小説】",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:50+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/brainy_elk1055/n/n6a4638d4bf41"
    },
    {
      "key": "n20c89ad5f2e2",
      "text": "ゆで卵、回す子、剥く子、つかの間の平穏。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "はっぱ64",
      "handle": "casablancation",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "20字小説｜シロクマ文芸部",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:54+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/casablancation/n/n20c89ad5f2e2"
    },
    {
      "key": "n28d5f8bee77f",
      "text": "北風が吹く。落ち葉ときみが僕を抜き去る。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "いにしゃる",
      "handle": "jazzy_eider8033",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "【20字小説】とある一本道に【シロクマ文芸部】",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:00:59+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/jazzy_eider8033/n/n28d5f8bee77f"
    },
    {
      "key": "nd560a68b4f30",
      "text": "終わりを迎えても、僕の人生を変え続ける。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "❁ Ordeal ❁",
      "handle": "brainy_elk1055",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "Dパート【シロクマ文芸部｜20字小説】",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:01:14+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/brainy_elk1055/n/nd560a68b4f30"
    },
    {
      "key": "n59b65d73abdb",
      "text": "「本」の語源は木の根っこ。なんだか納得。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "本棚の館長",
      "handle": "hon_to_toshokan",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "本の根っこ",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:01:19+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/hon_to_toshokan/n/n59b65d73abdb"
    },
    {
      "key": "n61bde87d39e3",
      "text": "君を想う。それだけで今日も幸せになれた。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "麦ちひろ",
      "handle": "oki_13",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "お題 : 20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:01:36+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/oki_13/n/n61bde87d39e3"
    },
    {
      "key": "nc9f5c769c697",
      "text": "お昼休みのお茶が待ち遠しい。時間が遅い。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "ふつうのひとU",
      "handle": "rosy_pika19",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "お茶　　20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:01:56+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/rosy_pika19/n/nc9f5c769c697"
    },
    {
      "key": "n2ce3d996dcb2",
      "text": "どこかで会ったことあるかな？え？！私だ！",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "Cara",
      "handle": "mtk_325",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "名前も知らない商店街でひと休み。ふと目の合った親子は、、｜＃20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:02:22+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/mtk_325/n/n2ce3d996dcb2"
    },
    {
      "key": "n71bbe4ab1c36",
      "text": "目を凝らす。捉えた輪郭は小さな宝物2つ。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "つきのおか みきこ",
      "handle": "tuskioka_mikiko",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "深夜0時 #20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:03:02+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/tuskioka_mikiko/n/n71bbe4ab1c36"
    },
    {
      "key": "n881ff15af2c3",
      "text": "弟が割った皿の隣に、私も一枚割っておく。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "片隅",
      "handle": "yazawa_kentaro",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "共犯｜20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:03:14+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/yazawa_kentaro/n/n881ff15af2c3"
    },
    {
      "key": "nb328396b2afa",
      "text": "あなたはなんと心の棚の広い人なんだろう。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "Pino_0111",
      "handle": "pino_qwer111",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "【20字小説】自分に甘く、他人に厳しい",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:03:28+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/pino_qwer111/n/nb328396b2afa"
    },
    {
      "key": "n9f6e7e67e595",
      "text": "平和は遠くとも、誰も傷つかぬ世界を望む。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "藍出 紡",
      "handle": "aide_tsumugu",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "シロクマ文芸部 20字小説",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:03:50+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/aide_tsumugu/n/n9f6e7e67e595"
    },
    {
      "key": "n9bd9bd300bf0",
      "text": "己の半生の事実を基に克明に描く長編大作。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "Pino_0111",
      "handle": "pino_qwer111",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "【20字小説】よくこんなお題で小説が書けますね",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:04:18+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/pino_qwer111/n/n9bd9bd300bf0"
    },
    {
      "key": "n14146ad6ae2a",
      "text": "ケンカした次の日の夫が提げて帰るアイス。",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "橘 ゆず",
      "handle": "yuzu343",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
      "title": "きっとハーゲンダッツ。|＃20字小説「シロクマ文芸部」",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T20:05:12+09:00",
      "url": "https://note.com/yuzu343/n/n14146ad6ae2a"
    },
    {
      "key": "n08c574ea6a8c",
      "text": "あの一歩を諦めてたら、幸せだったのかい？",
      "charCount": 20,
      "authorName": "haru",
      "handle": "haru_yk",
      "creditGroup": "club",
      "sourceType": "extracted",
